# Reference .theme file for plugins_examples/Themes.lua -- see White.theme's
# own header comment for the file format.
#
# Lush forest canopy: rounded cards, chevron + icon kept, centered, roomy
# -- meant to feel like a proper "outdoorsy app", not just a dark-green
# recolor.
